# What a Docker build of this repo never needs: installed packages and builds of the host
# (rebuilt for Linux inside the image), local secrets, git, and test output.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/test-reports
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
apps/web/e2e/.results
apps/web/e2e/.report
